    "8c8a3e036ea98935db1b829ee2f0e35bf2256de263564e106dc449e6e9798ae8": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "afc578e3b2ab90e8a23092422e77fba7e4e65dd101487e26d2a868c6e78a4554",
      "contextFingerprint": "f008216afa794f2d2da6d39cd1286b38d2925861bd8de32aa2723fcfd185e12f",
      "sourceText": "1.  工程构成：stm32工程是由C语言和汇编语言的库组成的工程，所以有主函数，符合C/C++语言的结构。\n\n2.  程序运行顺序：除了预编译等，程序从主函数开始运行，而且非常符合C/C++运行顺序，从主函数开始会逐行运行代码，然后会进入死循环。\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image94.webp)\n\n3.  主函数内必须的组成部分：死循环\\[while(true)或者for(;;)\\]，因为单片机要一直运行下去，所以有个死循环。\n\n4.  HAL库 与 用户自定义库\n\n    1.  库：\n\n        1.  .h文件声明函数\n\n        2.  .c/.cpp文件定义函数\n\n        3.  .c/.cpp文件调用函数\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image95.webp)",
      "translatedText": "1.  Project composition: an STM32 project is a project composed of C language and assembly language libraries, so it has a main function and conforms to the structure of the C/C\\+\\+ language\\.\n\n2.  Program execution order: apart from preprocessing and similar steps, the program starts running from the main function, and it conforms very closely to the C/C\\+\\+ execution order: starting from the main function, the code runs line by line, and then enters an infinite loop\\.\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image94.webp)\n\n3.  Required components within the main function: an infinite loop\\[while(true)或者for(;;)\\]because the microcontroller must keep running, so there is an infinite loop\\.\n\n4.  HAL library and user\\-defined libraries\n\n    1.  Libraries:\n\n        1.  \\.h files declare functions\n\n        2.  \\.c/\\.cpp files define functions\n\n        3.  \\.c/\\.cpp files call functions\n\n    ![](https://cdn.tungchiahui.cn/tungwebsite/assets/images/2023/10/09/image95.webp)",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 275,
        "outputTokens": 176,
        "costUsd": 0.000294
      }
    },
